cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "SecLoop: LLM-Based Security Automation with SA-GRPO for Zero-Touch Networks"
abstract: >-
  SecLoop is a framework for fully automated security strategy generation,
  orchestration, response and feedback, together with SA-GRPO, a security-aware
  group relative policy optimization algorithm for tuning the
  strategy-generating model. The repository ships an isolated two-VM reference
  scenario that exercises the complete feedback loop.
